#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/index.rst:4
#: 2e97d761099c4bbc9b03e1e58633ff29
msgid ""
"NepTrainKit 用于准备、检查和可视化 NEP 训练数据。它负责生成候选结构、检查异常"
"样本、 筛选代表结构和回看训练结果；DFT 标注与 GPUMD 训练仍在对应软件中完成。"
msgstr "NepTrainKit prepares, inspects, and visualizes NEP training data. It generates candidate structures, checks for anomalous samples, selects representative structures, and helps review training results; DFT labeling and GPUMD training are still carried out in the corresponding software."

