"开软件、 只是看不懂某个页面或参数时，直接进入“功能指南”。"
msgstr "Choose an entry point based on what you are trying to do. Only first-time users need to read Quick Start from beginning to end; if the application is already open and you need to look up a page or parameter, go straight to the Feature Guide."

