msgid "NepTrainKit 在训练流程中的位置是："
msgstr "NepTrainKit fits into the training workflow as follows:"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/index.rst:85
#: f2e8613c39404fe3b0652635915e0381
msgid ""
"生成数据集 生成候选结构\n"
"→ NEP Dataset Display 检查并清洗异常结构\n"
"→ FPS Filter 或其他方法选择代表结构\n"
"→ DFT 标注能量、力、应力\n"
"→ GPUMD 训练 NEP\n"
"→ NEP Dataset Display 回看误差并开始下一轮"
msgstr "Make Dataset: generate candidate structures\n→ NEP Dataset Display: inspect and clean anomalous structures\n→ FPS Filter or another method: select representative structures\n→ DFT: label energies, forces, and stresses\n→ GPUMD: train the NEP model\n→ NEP Dataset Display: review errors and start the next iteration"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/index.rst:94
#: cc3a992acd3f4010816c13a62aeff63f
msgid ""
"如果你是在完成一整段工作，而不是查询单个按钮，进入 :doc:`workflows/index`。 "
"如果你已经知道具体目标，例如能量平移、最大误差筛选或 DFT-D3 修正，进"
"入 :doc:`example/index`。"
msgstr "If you are completing an end-to-end task rather than looking up one button, open :doc:`workflows/index`. If you already have a specific objective, such as shifting energies, selecting the largest-error structures, or applying a DFT-D3 correction, open :doc:`example/index`."

